    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3284" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκόλλ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not cemented</i> or
				<i>glued</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					35.43
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Dclos</span>); <i>not adhering</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα σώμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.125
				</span></i>
			; <i>not united, healed up</i>, of wounds, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18(2).802
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>incapable of being compacted</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				22
			</span></i>.</div>
